very helpful, and fun, to have monsters attack each other.  It reminds
me of the conflict-induced battle between the cockatrice and lizard I
once had.  (The lizard won, if anyone's interested).

Did you ID the scroll of genocide, yet?
If you didn't, I would wish for 2 cursed scrolls of genocide.
If you did, wish for a cursed magic marker and write some cursed
scrolls of genocide.
Read them to reverse genocide various monsters, depending on what you
need:
-nurses: take off all of your armor and unwield your weapon on a no-
teleport level, read the scroll, and sit back and relax to watch your
max hp climb.
-tengu: instrinc teleport and teleport control, tin their corpses and
eat them
-wraith: dip their corpses in holy water, then eat them to gain
levels.

